that reads it."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"8e40d489-89e7-4945-9057-aec7adcc6d43"],

Cell["\<\
An edge is horizontal when its endpoints lie over different base vertices.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"7ce6dc48-d452-4342-869b-12fe4edb2555"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["Graph",
    BaseStyle->"Link"], "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["total", "TI"], " ", 
     StyleBox["vertices", "TI"]}], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["edges", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a82641f3-1f55-4298-a4cf-4ce449807ce7"],
 " is the connection graph. Its components are the horizontal leaves."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a16f4510-d6ad-43b3-aafe-bd0fbf62ce27"],

